Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.93,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去朝拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Siyo nqoba
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一头狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingonyama
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一头狮子和一头豹子来到这片开阔地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingonyama nengw' enamabala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,一头狮子和一头豹子来到这片开阔地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingonyama nengw' enamabala
