Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一头狮子和一头豹子来到这片开阔地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingonyama nengw' enamabala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,生命伊始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the day we arrive on the planet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,眨眨眼睛  感受阳光{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, blinking, step into the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,世间万物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more to see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,应接不暇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Than can ever be seen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,未做之事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,永无穷尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Than can ever be done
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,人生旅程  充满惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's far too much to take in here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要去体会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More to find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,它的真谛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Than can ever be found
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色天际{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the sun rolling high
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,红日升起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the sapphire sky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大大小小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeps great and small
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,轮回过往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the endless round
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the circle of life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,循环不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it moves us all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,经历失望与希冀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through despair and hope
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,经历忠贞与爱意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through faith and love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,找准自己位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till we find our place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命长河中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the path unwinding
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命之环里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the circle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The circle of life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the circle of life
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,循环不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it moves us all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,经历失望与希冀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through despair and hope
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,经历忠贞与爱意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through faith and love
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,找准自己位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till we find our place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命长河中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the path unwinding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命之环里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the circle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The circle of life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,《狮子王》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,命运真不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's not fair, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我呢  永远成不了国王了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I... Well, I shall never be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而你  也永远见不到明天了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you shall never see the light of another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈没教过你  别玩弄猎物吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't your mother ever tell you not to play with your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你来干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来通知你  木法沙王就要到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to announce that King Mufasa's on his way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,今早仪式你缺席了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you'd better have a good excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好找个理由解释解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for missing the ceremony morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你害我丢了午餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've made me lose my lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等国王来了  你何止丢掉午餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll lose more than that when the king gets through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他生起气来比疝气的河马还恐怖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's as mad as a hippo with a hernia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我好怕怕哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I quiver with fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,行了  刀疤  别这么看我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Scar, don't look at me that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,尊敬的陛下  您来的真是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impeccable timing, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我大哥嘛  哪阵风把您吹来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, if it isn't my big brother descending from on high
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,纡尊降贵和我这平民厮混{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to mingle with the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我和沙拉碧在辛巴的洗礼仪式上没看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarabi and I didn't see you at the presentation of Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是今天吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真是抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel simply awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我给忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must've slipped my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你这滑头应该记得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, as slippery as your mind is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.37,0:06:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,国王的弟弟本该位列首席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the king's brother, you should've been first in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这小毛球出生之前  我才是首席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was first in line, until the little hairball was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.37,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这小毛球是我儿子  是你未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hairball is my son and your future king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那我得好好练习下礼节{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall practise my curtsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  不要背对着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't turn your back on me, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.88,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,错了  木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是你不该不理睬我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you shouldn't turn your back on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在挑衅吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,息怒  息怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temper, temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我做梦也不敢向你挑衅啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't dream of challenging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.06,0:06:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真遗憾  为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要说头脑  我的确有狮子的智慧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, as far as brains go, I got the lion's share.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但要说力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when it comes to brute strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我就拖狮子的后腿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I'm at the shallow end of the gene pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,家家都有本难念的经啊  陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one in every family, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家还不止一本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two in mine, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,在特别场合总会出点岔子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they always manage to ruin special occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我该拿他怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I going to do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他是块做地毯的好材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd make a very handsome throw rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.43,0:07:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,想想  那样的话  只要他脏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just think, whenever he gets dirty,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以把他拎出去打一打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could take him out and beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.87,0:08:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,快  爸爸  该出发了  快醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, dad, we gotta go! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你儿子醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son is awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,日出之前  是你儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before sunrise, he's your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  快起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Come on, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好好  我起来  起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Okay. I'm up, I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.93,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,阳光所及的地方  都是我们的国土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything the light touches is our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,国王的统治就像太阳一样  有升有落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A king's time as ruler rises and falls like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  有一天  我会随太阳一同落下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, Simba, the sun will set on my time here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,日出时  你会一同升起  成为新王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and will rise with you as the new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-这都属于我吗  -所有的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And this'll all be mine? - Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阳光所及的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything the light touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那阳光到不了的地方呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about that shadowy place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.15,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那里不属于我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's beyond our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你可千万别去  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must never go there, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为国王能想做什么就做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought a king can do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,国王可不能随心所欲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, there's more to being king
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,为所欲为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than getting your way all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-国王还要干什么  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's more? - Simba...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,世上万物和谐共存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you see exists together in a delicate balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,国王就得理解这种平衡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As king, you need to understand that balance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,并且尊重所有的生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and respect all the creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从满地爬的蚂蚁  到跳跃的羚羊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the crawling ant to the leaping antelope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但是爸爸  羚羊不是我们的食物吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, dad, don't we eat the antelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  辛巴  我解释给你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Simba, but let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们死后  身体化为草地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we die, our bodies become the grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而羚羊以草为食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the antelope eat the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在生命循环中紧密相连{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so we are all connected in the great circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-早上好  陛下  -早上好  沙祖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good morning, sire! - Good morning, Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,来给您作一下晨间报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checking in with the morning report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂的嗡嗡声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well! The buzz from the bees
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,为豹子一家带来一点困扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that the leopards are in a bit of a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子  干什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,扑东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让老猎手教教你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let an old pro show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要大象们别担心  但他们就是不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told the elephants to forget it, but they can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-沙祖  能转个身吗  -是  陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zazu, would you turn around? - Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,猎豹食物紧缺  但...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cheetahs are hard up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,趴在草地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay low to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,猎豹没办法兴旺繁衍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheetahs never prosper...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  趴在草地上吗  行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, okay. Stay low to the ground, right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了  -扑倒课程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What going on? - A pouncing lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  扑倒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good. Pouncing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,扑倒  别啊  陛下  别开玩笑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pouncing? No, sire, you can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,太丢脸了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.35,0:10:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别出声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙  你在跟他说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you telling him, Mufasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa? Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-沙祖  -什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Zazu! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-来自地下的情报  -好的  这次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- News from the underground. - Now, this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下  土狼来犯荣耀大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sire! Hyenas in the Pride Lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  带辛巴回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu, take Simba home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  我能一起去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, can't I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,哪儿都不让我去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never get to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,小主人  有朝一日  你成了国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Young master, one day, you will be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,就能赶走那些  一天到晚虎视眈眈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you can chase those slobbering, mangy, stupid poachers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,贪婪丑陋愚蠢的偷猎者了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from dawn until dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤叔叔  你猜怎么着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Uncle Scar! Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌猜来猜去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I despise guessing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会成为荣耀石国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be King of Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.07,0:11:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很好啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, goody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸向我展示了整个王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad just showed me the whole kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都归我管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm gonna rule it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.37,0:11:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  原谅我没高兴地跳起来为你鼓掌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Well, forgive me for not leaping for joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的背不太好  你知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Uncle Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我当了国王  那你是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I'm king, what'll that make you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,猴子的叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A monkey's uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-你真奇怪  -你懂什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're so weird. - You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸向你展示了整个王国  是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, your father showed you the whole kingdom, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有国土{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他向你展示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't show you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,北部边境那块高地了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's beyond that rise at the northern border?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  他说我不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no. He said I can't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他说得太对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那里太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's far too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,只有最勇敢的狮子才能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the bravest lions go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我很勇敢啊  那里有什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm brave. What's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  辛巴  我不能说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Simba, I just can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  我得保证爱侄儿的安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba Simba, I'm only looking out for the well-being of my favourite nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我是你唯一的侄子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right! I'm your only nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我得保护你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the more reason for me to be protective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小王子可不能去大象墓地  糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An elephant graveyard is no place for a young prince. Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大象什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An elephant what? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的  我话太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear, I've said too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  估计你迟早也会发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I suppose you'd have found out sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you being so clever and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do me one favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.27,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,答应我  千万别去那个可怕的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me you'll never visit that dreadful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a good lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,自己去玩吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You run along now and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们之间的小秘密哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-好啊  娜娜  -你好  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Nala. - Hi, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,走  我刚听说有个好玩的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I just heard about this great place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  我正洗澡呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba! I'm kind of in the middle of a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.13,0:13:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该洗了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's time for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  你把我鬃毛弄乱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, you're messing up my mane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了  干净了  我能走了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, I'm clean. Can we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别又是什么无聊的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better not be anyplace dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不是  很好玩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.15,0:13:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这个好玩的地方在哪啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where is this really cool place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-水潭附近  -水潭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Around the water hole. - The water hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,水潭那有什么好玩的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so great about the water hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到了再给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈  我能和辛巴一起去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, can I go with Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢  沙拉碧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Sarabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-求你了  -求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please? - Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我没意见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了  -好哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但沙祖得跟着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as Zazu goes with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.63,0:14:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别啊  别让沙祖去嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,早点去水潭玩  早点回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sooner we get to the water hole, the sooner we can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们到底是要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where are we really going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一个叫大象墓地的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An elephant graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖还在呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对  我们怎么甩掉这笨笨呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. So, how are we gonna ditch the dodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.65,0:14:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你们俩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just look at you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,爱情的种子在草原上发芽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little seeds of romance blossoming in the savanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你俩订婚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents will be thrilled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们父母一定会高兴坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what with your being betrothed and all.
