Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能娶她  她是我朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't marry her. She's my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  太奇怪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it'd be so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打破了你俩的美梦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to bust your bubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩小家伙可没得选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you two turtle doves have no choice.
