Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有任何束缚  -你不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one sayin', "Stop that" - You don't realise...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:15:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有任何指令  -都听我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one sayin', "See here" - Now, see here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,整天自由奔跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free to run around all day
