Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-甩掉他了  -我真天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We lost him. - I am a genius.
