Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一种办法能弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,走  咱们进去瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  你现在唯一该做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong! The only checking out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就是抓紧离开这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will do will be to check out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有没搞错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这里早不是荣耀大地了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're way beyond the boundary of the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,看  尖嘴小老头害怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, banana beak is scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我尖嘴先生  小毛孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mr banana beak to you, fuzzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们的处境十分危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and right now we are all in very real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我在荒野中行走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I walk on the wild side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,笑对危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I laugh in the face of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀  班仔  看看谁送上门来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well, Banzai, what have we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不清楚啊  桑琪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Shenzi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢  艾德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,和我想的一样嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,三个入侵者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A trio of trespassers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证  这是个误会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And quite by accident, let me assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,路线定位失误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple navigational error.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你  你是木法沙的小跟班嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you. You're Mufasa's little stooge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,女士  我是国王的管家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, madam, am the king's major-domo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说  你就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that would make you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,未来的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们怎么对待领土外的国王吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what we do to kings who step out of their kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把我怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上他们可以  我们在他们的领土上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, they can. We are on their land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  你告诉过我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Zazu, you told me they're nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不过是贪婪丑陋愚蠢的偷猎者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but slobbering, mangy, stupid poachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要提愚蠢二字[密语]{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ix-nay on the upid-stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-你说谁愚蠢  -我的天啊  都这个时候了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you callin' upid-stay? - My, my, my. Look at the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们该走了  -急什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's time to go! - What's the hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们希望你们能留下来晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd love you to stick around for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以吃狮子大餐啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we could have whatever's lion around!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  我想到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait, I got one, I got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,来个幼崽三明治  怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make mine a cub sandwich! What's ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  艾德  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, Ed? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们点了份外卖吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, did we order this dinner to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没啊  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause there it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们逃掉了吗  -应该是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did we lose 'em? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖哪去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Zazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让你这个小管家鸟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little major-domo bird hippety-hopped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,蹦蹦跳跳到煮鸟锅里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the way to the birdie-boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不  别让我进煮鸟锅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Not the birdie-boiler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,以大欺小  真不害臊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, why don't you pick on somebody your own size?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-那换成你怎么样  -糟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like you? - Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.37,0:21:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,过来  小崽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, kitty, kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次  快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it again. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-手下留情  大爷  手下留情  -闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, please! Uncle, uncle! - Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们马上闭嘴  -息怒  我们真的错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're gonna shut up right now! - Calm down. We're really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你敢再靠近我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever come near my son again...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这  这是您儿子吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is... This is your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.87,0:22:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-您的儿子  -你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your son. - Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不知道  我哪知道  你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Me? I didn't know... No, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-不  当然不知道  -就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, of course not. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.96,0:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,艾德你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.97,0:22:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸  我  -你明知故犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad, I... - You deliberately disobeyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸  我  我错了  -回家再说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad, I'm... I'm sorry. - Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你很勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were very brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.33,0:23:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.92,0:23:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在  陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把娜娜带回家  我得教训教训儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Nala home. I've got to teach my son a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧  娜娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你太让我失望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, I'm very disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.39,0:23:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-我明白  -你差点丧命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know. - You could've been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.89,0:24:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我三令五申  你却明知故犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deliberately disobeyed me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,更危险的是  你还陷娜娜于危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what's worse, you put Nala in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想像你一样勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just trying to be brave, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.82,0:24:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只在需要勇敢的时候勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only brave when I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, being brave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,并不意味着自找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't mean you go looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但你什么都不怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not scared of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.25,0:24:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我很害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.46,0:24:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗  -真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You were? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕会失去你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I might lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,原来国王也会害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess even kings get scared, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.26,0:24:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-可你知道吗  -什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you know what? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那些土狼更害怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think those hyenas were even scareder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那是没人敢惹你老爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause nobody messes with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.98,0:24:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-过来  小家伙  -不要  不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come here, you. - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.53,0:24:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.95,0:24:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.62,0:25:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们是伙伴吧  -是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're pals, right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.45,0:25:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会永远在一起吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we'll always be together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  我来告诉你一些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, let me tell you something
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.89,0:25:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲告诉过我的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that my father told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.30,0:25:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看那些星星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.55,0:25:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,先王们在星星上关注着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The great kings of the past look down on us from those stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.80,0:25:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗  -真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,当你感觉寂寞的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So whenever you feel alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.18,0:25:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,记得那些君王一直会指引着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just remember that those kings will always be there to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会守护着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.03,0:25:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那个烦人的木法沙  害我一个星期坐不下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, that lousy Mufasa. I won't be able to sit for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.87,0:25:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么好笑的  艾德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not funny, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.34,0:25:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你们能不能别折腾了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you knock it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-他先挑起来的  -看看你们自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, he started it. - Look at you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.43,0:26:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得我们在食物链底端晃荡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder we're dangling at the bottom of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.97,0:26:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌晃荡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I hate dangling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.52,0:26:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  要不是那些狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? If it weren't for those lions,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.35,0:26:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方早就是我们的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd be runnin' the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.48,0:26:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I hate lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.98,0:26:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-顽固  -毛多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So pushy. - And hairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-臭哄哄  -还有他们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And stinky. -And, man, are they...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,丑死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,显然我们狮子不全是那么差{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely we lions are not all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  原来是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar. It's just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.04,0:26:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还以为是什么大人物呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were afraid it was somebody important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.21,0:26:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀  就像木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you know, like Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.71,0:26:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-没错  -我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.33,0:26:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-他才是权威  -说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now that's power! - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,光听见他的名字我就发抖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hear that name and I shudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-木法沙  -再来一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mufasa! - Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.22,0:26:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙  木法沙  木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa! Mufasa! Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一听我就哆嗦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It tingles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.18,0:26:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我身边净是些白痴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surrounded by idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧  刀疤  你和我们气味相投{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you, Scar, I mean, you're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.16,0:26:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我们是一伙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you're our pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.35,0:26:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-真荣幸  -就喜欢你这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charmed. - I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不是国王  却有国王的架子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not king, but he's still so proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.77,0:26:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,对了  你给我们带吃的了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Hey, did you bring us anything to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.74,0:26:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  哥们  带了吗  带了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar, old buddy, old pal? Huh? Did ya, did ya, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,事都办不利索  还要什么吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you really deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.36,0:27:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我几乎是把小家伙们打包送来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I practically gift-wrapped those cubs for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.53,0:27:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可你们还是让他们跑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you couldn't even dispose of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.58,0:27:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可你知道  不单他们俩在  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know, it wasn't exactly like they was alone, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.75,0:27:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就是  我们能怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What were we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了木法沙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill Mufasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,正是如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道你们这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that your powers of retention
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,根本派不上什么用场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are as wet as a warthog's backside
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是站好了  仔细听着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But thick as you are, pay attention
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.12,0:27:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的言语中饱含骄傲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My words are a matter of pride
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.95,0:27:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,与你们的茫然大有不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clear from your vacant expressions
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.75,0:27:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就算王权我能分一杯羹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lights are not all on upstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:28:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觊觎的是王位继承{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're talking kings and successions
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.26,0:28:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事早是众人皆知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even you can't be caught unawares
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,静候着仅有的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So prepare for the chance of a lifetime
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,迎接这轰动的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be prepared for sensational news
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.52,0:28:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,崭新的时代近在眼前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A shiny new era is tiptoeing nearer
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.44,0:28:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们做点什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where do we feature?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.11,0:28:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,只要听我吩咐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just listen to teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来卑鄙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know it sounds sordid
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.36,0:28:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但总会有你们的好处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll be rewarded
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等到我终于大业得成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When at last I am given my dues
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都会被论"功"行赏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And injustice deliciously squared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.58,0:28:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好  去准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会准备好的  准备什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be prepared. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.05,0:28:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,准备让国王受死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the death of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.42,0:28:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么  他病了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, is he sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.33,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没有  笨蛋  我们要杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, fool, we're going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.97,0:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有辛巴  -好主意  要国王干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And Simba, too. - Great idea. Who needs a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要国王  不要国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No king, no king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.26,0:28:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货  会有新的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots! There will be a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.77,0:28:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你说...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, but you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.35,0:28:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我将是新的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be king!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.44,0:28:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stick with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.23,0:29:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就再也不会挨饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'll never go hungry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.23,0:29:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了  -国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! All right! - Long live the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,国王万岁  国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king! Long live the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.99,0:29:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,族群靠山指日可待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great that we'll soon be connected
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.33,0:29:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,至高国王再好不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a king who'll be all-time adored
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是自然  好生活近在眼前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, quid pro quo you're expected
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.25,0:29:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,只要为我办件小事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To take certain duties on board
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.38,0:29:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,任务完成就能得赏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is littered with prizes
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管多数甜头都落在我头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And though I'm the main addressee
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须强调的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point that I must emphasise is
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我你们都活不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't get a sniff without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.94,0:29:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这次行动史无前例{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So prepare for the coup of the century
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.61,0:29:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,准备施行这条诡计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be prepared for the murkiest scam
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.07,0:29:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天衣无缝的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meticulous planning
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,死不回头的决心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tenacity spanning
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.78,0:29:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,数十载受人轻视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decades of denial
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.95,0:29:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,无疑是我将称王的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is simply why I'll be king undisputed
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.71,0:29:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,众人尊敬  众人敬礼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respected, saluted
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,众人都会看见我的闪光点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And seen for the wonder l am
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我的牙齿和野心一同赤裸在外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my teeth and ambitions are bared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.47,0:30:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我的牙齿和野心赤裸在外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, our teeth and ambitions are bared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.89,0:30:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.28,0:30:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等着  你爸爸为你准备了个大惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait here. Your father has a marvellous surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.83,0:30:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.16,0:30:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你  就不叫惊喜了  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I told you, it wouldn't be a surprise now, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.50,0:30:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我  我就假装惊讶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you tell me, I'll still act surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.84,0:30:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个小淘气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are such a naughty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.51,0:30:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-快说吧  刀疤叔叔  -不不不不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Uncle Scar. - No, no, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你跟你爸爸的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just for you and your daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.18,0:30:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那种父子之间的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, a sort of father-son thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.89,0:30:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我得去找他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'd better go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.81,0:31:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-我跟你一起去  -不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll go with you. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不  待在这块石头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Just stay on this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会又想捅娄子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't want to end up in another mess
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.03,0:31:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就像上回土狼那次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you did with the hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.86,0:31:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么知道  -辛巴  谁不知道啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know about that? -Simba, everybody knows about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.78,0:31:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吧  -真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.45,0:31:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好爸爸及时出手相救  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky daddy was there to save you, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.25,0:31:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是我们之间的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.04,0:31:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好还是练习一下你的小嗓门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you might want to work on that little roar of yours, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.59,0:31:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.09,0:31:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤叔叔  我会喜欢那个惊喜吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Uncle Scar, will I like this surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你会喜欢死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, it's to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.46,0:32:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.92,0:32:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不了啦  好饿  我得吃一头角马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help it. I'm so hungry. I got to have a wildebeest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,待着别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就一头又小又病的也不行吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't I just pick off one of the little sick ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  我们要等刀疤的信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We wait for the signal from Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了  行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"小嗓门"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Little roar."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下  快看  角马群来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sire, the herd is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-奇怪  -木法沙  快来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Odd. - Mufasa, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.96,0:33:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,峡谷里的角马群受惊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stampede in the gorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.96,0:33:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-辛巴在那儿  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Simba's down there! -Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.69,0:33:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.24,0:33:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸正往这儿赶  坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father is on the way! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:33:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿  那根树枝上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There! There on that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.75,0:34:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.50,0:34:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.05,0:34:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  太可怕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar, this is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.17,0:34:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办  我们该怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'll we do? What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.43,0:34:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我回去搬救兵  就这么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go back for help, that's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.03,0:34:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我回去...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.05,0:34:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.99,0:35:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.32,0:35:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,弟弟  弟弟  救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother. Brother, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.34,0:35:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,国王万岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.86,0:36:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.54,0:36:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.46,0:36:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.42,0:36:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,该起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.38,0:37:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.42,0:37:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.56,0:37:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.61,0:37:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,来人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.48,0:37:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.65,0:37:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,救命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.85,0:38:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你都做了些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba. What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.15,0:38:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有一群角马  爸爸想救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were wildebeests, and he tried to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.28,0:38:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是意外  我没想到会这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an accident. I didn't mean for it to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.16,0:38:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了  你当然没想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Of course you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.99,0:38:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没人希望事情变成这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever means for these things to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.00,0:38:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但国王死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the king is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.67,0:38:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你  他死不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if it weren't for you, he'd still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.34,0:38:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈会怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will your mother think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.14,0:38:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.68,0:38:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,逃走吧  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run away, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.35,0:38:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,跑吧  跑得远远的  再也别回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run. Run away and never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.58,0:39:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿  他在那儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there he goes. There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.25,0:39:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去抓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要去那儿呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There ain't no way I'm going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  想让我跟你一样  变成仙人掌吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you want me to come out looking like you, cactus butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.26,0:39:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们得完成任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we got to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.72,0:39:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,反正他离开这儿活不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's as good as dead out there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.81,0:40:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他要是回来了  我们再杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he comes back, we'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.60,0:40:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  听见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.06,0:40:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你再回来  我们就杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever come back, we'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.74,0:40:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙的死是场可怕的悲剧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa's death is a terrible tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是辛巴那么小年纪就也...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to lose Simba, who had barely begun to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对我而言  损失的实在太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, it is a deep, personal loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.13,0:40:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我怀着沉重的心情登上王位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it is with a heavy heart that I assume the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们必须从悲伤中振作起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet out of the ashes of this tragedy we shall rise
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.51,0:40:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迎接新时代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to greet the dawning of a new era
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.60,0:40:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,狮子与土狼同进退的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which lion and hyena come together
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.48,0:40:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大而辉煌的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a great and glorious future.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.03,0:41:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,走开  走开  都走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.33,0:41:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我特喜欢把这秃鹰群滚走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love this! Bowling for buzzards.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.54,0:41:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gets 'em every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.87,0:41:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  快过来看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Timon, you better come look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.21,0:41:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好的  是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All righty, what have we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪  是一头狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, it's a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑  彭彭  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, Pumbaa, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.73,0:42:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  小狮子而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Timon, it's just a little lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.10,0:42:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看看他  好可爱  而且就一人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at him. He's so cute and all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.07,0:42:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以养他吗  -彭彭  你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we keep him? - Pumbaa, are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.32,0:42:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是一头狮子  我们可是他的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about a lion. Lions eat guys like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.66,0:42:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-可是他才那么小  -他会长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But he's so little. - He's going to get bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.24,0:42:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他会跟我们一伙儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he'll be on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.41,0:42:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是我听过最蠢的事  也许他会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the stupidest thing I ever heard. Maybe he'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.58,0:42:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我有主意了  要是他跟我们一伙儿的呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I've got it. What if he's on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.92,0:42:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,傍上只狮子朋友也不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, having a lion around might not be such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那可以养吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're keeping him?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.51,0:42:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以  不看看这里谁是老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Who's the brains of this outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.84,0:42:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,自然是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My point exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.59,0:42:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪  我要被烤死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, I'm fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.89,0:42:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这儿找个荫凉地方待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here and find some shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.44,0:42:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧  小孩儿  -应该没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay, kid? - I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.77,0:42:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你差点儿死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You nearly died.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.11,0:42:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.78,0:42:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  彭彭也帮忙了  一点点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Pumbaa helped. A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.03,0:43:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.03,0:43:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哪也不去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.70,0:43:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他看上去心情不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, he looks blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.12,0:43:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒觉得他看起来是金褐色的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say brownish gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.06,0:43:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这个意思  我说他很沮丧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. I mean he's depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.13,0:43:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子  谁想吃了你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, what's eating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.25,0:43:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能  狮子在食物链的顶部{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. He's at the top of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.72,0:43:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能吃得了狮子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The food chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.31,0:43:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.81,0:43:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢  我又不能回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares? I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.06,0:43:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你无家可归啦  很好啊  我们也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an outcast. That's great. So are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.44,0:43:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你做错了什么  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.81,0:43:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.90,0:43:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再谈了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.47,0:43:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不想听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.99,0:43:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  丁满  我们能帮什么忙吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Timon. Anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.28,0:43:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们能改变过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unless you can change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.99,0:43:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  孩子  这种时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, kid, in times like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.68,0:43:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥们丁满会说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my buddy Timon here says,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.33,0:43:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"你得把你的背后抛到过去"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You got to put your behind in your past."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.95,0:43:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不对  不对  不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.62,0:43:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-我说的是...-外行了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean... - Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,班门弄斧  小心斧子伤了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down before you hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.67,0:43:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是"你得把过去抛诸脑后"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's, "You got to put your past behind you."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.50,0:43:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  孩子  人生不如意十之八九{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, kid, bad things happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.14,0:44:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很多时候我们无能为力  对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can't do anything about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.63,0:44:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-对  -错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right. - Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界背弃你的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the world turns its back on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.43,0:44:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你也背弃这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you turn your back on the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.18,0:44:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可我以前学的不是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's not what I was taught.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.18,0:44:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那或许你需要再上一课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then maybe you need a new lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.52,0:44:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.86,0:44:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-无忧无虑[斯瓦西里语]  -什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hakuna matata. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.86,0:44:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,斯瓦西里语是东非地区如肯尼亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}塔桑尼亚等所使用的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.15,0:44:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑[斯瓦西里语]{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.82,0:44:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是  "没有烦恼忧愁"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means "No worries".
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.53,0:44:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.16,0:44:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,多么美妙的词语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.37,0:44:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.83,0:44:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一时兴起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no passing craze
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.17,0:44:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,往后的时光里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt means no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.54,0:44:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必再担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of your days
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.71,0:44:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是让人没烦恼的处世哲学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our problem-free philosophy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.84,0:44:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.39,0:44:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.22,0:44:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对  这是我们的座右铭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's our motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.70,0:44:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,座右铭是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a motto?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.89,0:44:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  你有什么要座吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothin'. What's-a-motto with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.89,0:44:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.35,0:44:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.56,0:44:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这个词语会解决你所有的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these two words will solve all your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  比如彭彭就是因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Take Pumbaa, for example. Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.70,0:45:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当他是一头小野猪的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was a young warthog
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,当我是一头小野猪的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a young warthog
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.41,0:45:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-唱得不错  -谢谢夸奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very nice. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.70,0:45:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他发现自己散发的气味  有些问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He found his aroma lacked a certain appeal
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,每次他吃完饭  草原上一干二净{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could clear the savanna after every meal
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.71,0:45:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实内心纤细敏感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a sensitive soul
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.88,0:45:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管看上去皮糙肉厚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I seem thick-skinned
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.59,0:45:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友从不顺风站着  让我很伤心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it hurt that my friends never stood downwind
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.85,0:45:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有羞愧  -他很羞愧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And, oh, the shame - He was ashamed
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.52,0:45:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-曾想过改名换姓  -是名字的问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thought of changing my name -Oh, what's in a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.06,0:45:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我心情沮丧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got downhearted
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.69,0:45:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-你觉得如何  -每次我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How did you feel? - Every time that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-别在孩子面前说这些  -不好意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, not in front of the kids. - Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.57,0:45:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,多么奇妙的词语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a wonderful phrase
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.78,0:45:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一时兴起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no passing craze
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.08,0:45:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lt means no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.37,0:45:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必再担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of your days
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.29,0:45:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对  一起唱  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sing it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.08,0:46:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是让人没烦恼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our problem-free
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.59,0:46:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,处世哲学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philosophy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.80,0:46:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.80,0:46:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到寒舍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to our humble home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.80,0:46:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们住在这吗  -我们爱住哪就住哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You live here? - We live wherever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.47,0:46:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  屁股坐下的地方就是家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. Home is where your rump rests.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.06,0:46:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.81,0:46:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.06,0:46:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我饿得能吃下一整只斑马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so hungry I could eat a whole zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.82,0:46:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的斑马刚吃光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fresh out of zebra.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.23,0:46:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,有羚羊吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any antelope?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.99,0:46:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-河马呢  -也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hippo? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.65,0:46:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  孩子  要跟我们一起生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, kid, if you live with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.40,0:46:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你就得入乡随俗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to eat like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.91,0:46:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我看这地方能有好吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this looks like a good spot to rustle up some grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.66,0:46:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.12,0:46:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,蛆  你以为是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A grub. What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真恶心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.29,0:46:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,味道像鸡肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.67,0:46:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,黏滑但又美味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slimy yet satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.42,0:46:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是罕有的佳肴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are rare delicacies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.93,0:46:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,咬起来脆脆的  口感十足{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piquant, with a very pleasant crunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你会爱吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll learn to love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你吧  孩子  这种生活最棒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, kid, this is the great life,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.31,0:46:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没有规则  也没有责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no rules, no responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.69,0:47:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是带夹心的那种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The little cream-filled kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.44,0:47:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最棒的就是  没有忧虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And best of all, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.19,0:47:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗  孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.19,0:47:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well. Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.70,0:47:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,黏滑  但又美味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slimy, yet satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.54,0:47:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.47,0:47:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.72,0:47:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-无忧...  -从现在开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hakuna... - lt means no worries
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.48,0:47:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必再担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of your days
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.06,0:47:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是让人没烦恼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our problem-free
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.90,0:47:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,处世哲学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philosophy
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.23,0:48:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hakuna matata
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.90,0:48:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我见证的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.27,0:48:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,无人知晓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trouble I've seen
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.78,0:48:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,无人理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.62,0:48:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的悲伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.62,0:48:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  放松点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu, do lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.20,0:48:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,唱点活跃气氛的歌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sing something with a little bounce in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.37,0:48:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,世界真是小小小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a small world after all
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.37,0:48:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,世界真是小小小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}英文儿歌  暗示刀疤与辛巴会再相逢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.04,0:48:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别唱了  除了那首什么都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.76,0:48:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我摘了一堆可爱的椰子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a lovely bunch of coconuts
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.64,0:48:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把它们都摆好成一列{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are a-standing in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.14,0:49:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,大椰子  小椰子  有的跟头一样大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big ones, small ones, some as big as your head
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.39,0:49:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙在的时候从来不用做这种事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would never have had to do this with Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.39,0:49:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什么  你刚才说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.48,0:49:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-没什么  -规矩你知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - You know the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.82,0:49:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,永远别在我面前提他  我才是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never, ever mention that name in my presence. I am the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.82,0:49:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  陛下  您才是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sire, you are the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.91,0:49:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我...只是说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I only mentioned it
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.49,0:49:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你们管理王国方式有所不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to illustrate the differences in your royal managerial approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.50,0:49:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-老大  -这次又有什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, boss. - What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.83,0:49:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们有件事要抱怨一下  -我来说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got a bone to pick with you. - I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.17,0:49:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  这里没有食物  也没有水源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar, there's no food, no water.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.75,0:49:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没错  到了吃饭时间我们却没有主菜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's dinner time and we ain't got no stinking entrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.84,0:49:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,母狮子们负责打猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the lionesses' job to do the hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.35,0:49:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  可她们不去打猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but they won't go hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.51,0:49:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-吃了沙祖吧  -我可不好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Eat Zazu. - You wouldn't want me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.52,0:49:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的肉很硬  又臭又...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be so tough and gamey and...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.35,0:49:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沙祖  别逗了  加点大蒜就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zazu, don't be ridiculous. All you need is a little garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.86,0:49:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为木法沙时期吃不饱饭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought things were bad under Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.03,0:49:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-你刚才说什么  -我说木...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you say? - I said Muf...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.65,0:49:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我说  没啥[西班牙语]{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said que pasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.36,0:49:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  现在滚出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.03,0:50:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们还饿着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.37,0:50:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.13,0:50:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-打得真响  辛巴  -谢谢夸奖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! Nice one, Simba. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.38,0:50:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-我吃饱了  -我也饱了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Man, I'm stuffed. - Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃得像头猪一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ate like a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.72,0:50:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  你本来就是猪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, you are a pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.89,0:50:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.90,0:50:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-丁满  -什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Timon? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.74,0:50:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有想过天上那些闪闪小东西是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever wonder what those sparkling dots are up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.91,0:50:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  我不用想  我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, I don't wonder, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.16,0:50:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.08,0:50:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是萤火虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.92,0:50:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,被困在那个大蓝黑色玩意儿里的萤火虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fireflies that got stuck up in that big bluish-black thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.88,0:50:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是一团一团的气球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always thought they were balls of gas
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.76,0:51:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,在几十亿英里远的地方燃烧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burning billions of miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.93,0:51:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  对你来说  什么都是气儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, with you, everything's gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.10,0:51:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你怎么觉得呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.52,0:51:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个  我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.27,0:51:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快点说  说呀说呀说呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Give, give, give, give.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.40,0:51:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  我们都说了  拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We told you ours. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.44,0:51:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.45,0:51:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有人曾经告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody once told me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.86,0:51:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先王们从那儿关注着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the great kings of the past are up there watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.29,0:51:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说一群王族鬼魂正看着我们吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean a bunch of royal dead guys are watching us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁这么跟你说的  -是呀  是呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who told you something like that? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.13,0:51:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么人会编这种瞎话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mook made that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.47,0:51:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧  很蠢吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Pretty dumb, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.89,0:51:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-笑死我了  -是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're killing me. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.44,0:51:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我说错话了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.75,0:52:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.62,0:52:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他...还活着吗  他还活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's... He's alive? He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.68,0:53:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,时候到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.07,0:53:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在森林里  偌大的森林里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the jungle, the mighty jungle
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.28,0:53:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,狮子今夜安寝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lion sleeps tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,在森林里  偌大的森林里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the jungle, the mighty jungle
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.33,0:53:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,狮子今夜安...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lion sleeps to...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.25,0:53:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我听不见你的声音  哥们  替我和音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hear you, buddy. Back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.09,0:53:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  彭彭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa? Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.19,0:54:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.34,0:54:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.85,0:54:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  彭彭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa! Pumbaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.85,0:54:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,彭彭  彭彭  怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pumbaa, Pumbaa! Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.23,0:54:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她要吃了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going to eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.69,0:54:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老天爷  为什么我总要给你擦屁...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Jeez, why do I always have to save your...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.20,0:54:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  伙计  我会一直在你身边的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, buddy. I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.41,0:54:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.33,0:54:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咬她  咬她的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her! Bite her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.58,0:55:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,咬颈动脉  颈动脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go for the jugular! The jugular!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.54,0:55:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧  我就说他迟早能派上用场吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I told you he'd come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nala?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.35,0:55:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是你吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.27,0:55:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是谁  -是我  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - It's me. Simba.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.23,0:55:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.94,0:55:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么...-你怎么..{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! How did you... - How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.57,0:55:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.45,0:55:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真是  见到你真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gr... It's great to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.62,0:55:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你也真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.63,0:55:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-发生什么事了  -你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, what's goin' on here? - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.02,0:55:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.58,0:55:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思  那你在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean what am I doing here? What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.79,0:55:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What's goin' on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.17,0:55:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  这是娜娜  她是我最好的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon, this is Nala. She's my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.25,0:55:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-朋友  -对  彭彭  过来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Friend? - Yeah. Hey, Pumbaa, come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.47,0:55:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜  这是彭彭  彭彭  这是娜娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nala, this is Pumbaa. Pumbaa, Nala.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.93,0:55:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-很高兴认识你  -我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pleased to make your acquaintance. - The pleasure is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.64,0:55:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么  等一下  我先来弄弄清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you... Whoa, whoa! Time out! Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.10,0:56:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识她  她认识你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know her, she knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.90,0:56:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是她想吃了他  都觉得这事儿无所谓吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she wants to eat him, and everybody's okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.61,0:56:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-我是不是漏了什么  -放松点  丁满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I miss something? - Relax, Timon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.28,0:56:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让大家知道你一直都躲在这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait till everyone finds out you've been here all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.91,0:56:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈  她会怎么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your mother, what will she think?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.91,0:56:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她没必要知道  谁也没必要知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't have to know. Nobody has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.37,0:56:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他们当然得知道  大家都以为你已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course they do. Everyone thinks you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.79,0:56:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.96,0:56:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  刀疤把角马受惊的消息都告诉我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Scar told us about the stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.34,0:56:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  他还说了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did? What else did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.92,0:56:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,管他呢  你还活着  这就是说  你才是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else matters? You're alive. And that means, you're the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,国王  女士  你确定你弄清楚了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King? Lady, have you got your lions crossed!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.68,0:56:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.94,0:56:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下  我尘土在你脚下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty, I gravel at your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.15,0:56:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-别闹了  -不是尘土  是臣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop it. - It's not gravel, it's grovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.11,0:56:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也别胡说  他不是国王  你是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't! He's not the king. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.74,0:56:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是  -辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Simba!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.32,0:56:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不是国王  也许我原来会成为国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not the king. Maybe I was gonna be,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.95,0:56:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.33,0:57:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我把话说明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.42,0:57:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是国王  但是却没跟我们说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the king? And never told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.16,0:57:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-听着  我还是我啊  -但是你有了权力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, I'm still the same guy. - But with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.00,0:57:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我们单独谈会儿吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you guys excuse us for a few minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.13,0:57:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不管她想说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, whatever she has to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.92,0:57:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们面前都可以说  是吧  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she can say in front of us, right, Simba?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.30,0:57:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你们还是离开一下比较好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.01,0:57:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这就开始了  知人知面不知心啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It starts. You think you know a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.52,0:57:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满和彭彭  你会喜欢他们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon and Pumbaa, you learn to love 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.53,0:57:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.78,0:57:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是你复活了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like you're back from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.62,0:57:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道这对大家来说有多大意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know how much this will mean to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.50,0:57:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说有多重大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What it means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.16,0:57:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事的  -我真的一直很想你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, it's okay. - I've really missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.04,0:57:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.21,0:57:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说  彭彭  真是臭到家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, Pumbaa. This stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.72,0:57:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.84,0:58:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你  是他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you! Them!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.56,0:58:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他  和她  孤男寡女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Him, her, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.89,0:58:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.31,0:58:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-我都猜到会发生什么  -什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can see what's happening. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.81,0:58:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-他们却毫无头绪  -谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And they don't have a clue. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.48,0:58:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们将坠入爱河  而实际上是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll fall in love and here's the bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.07,0:58:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,三人组只剩你我二人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our trio's down to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.16,0:58:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,黎明的甜蜜爱抚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sweet caress of twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.28,0:58:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,处处充满奇迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's magic everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.33,0:58:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,伴随这浪漫气氛而来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with all this romantic atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.92,0:58:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,却是空气中灾难的因子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disaster's in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.01,0:58:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚  你是否感受到了我的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.68,0:58:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,宁静沉醉在黄昏暮霭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace the evening brings.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.19,0:58:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界终有一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.36,0:58:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,自然万物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In perfect harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.61,0:59:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如此和谐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all its living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.99,0:59:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我有那么多话想跟她说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many things to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不堪启齿的过往{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how to make her see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.25,0:59:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要如何告诉她一切真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth about my past?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能的  她会因此厌恶我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impossible, she'd turn away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.63,0:59:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他在退缩  他在逃避{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's holding back, he's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.97,0:59:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,但我却不能决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what, I can't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.22,0:59:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他为何不成为我心目中的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why won't he be the king I know he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.60,0:59:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那个他内心的王者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king I see inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚  你是否感受到了我的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.19,0:59:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,宁静沉醉在黄昏暮霭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace the evening brings.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.74,0:59:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,世界终于有一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.54,0:59:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,自然万物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In perfect harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如此和谐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all its living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.80,1:00:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚  你是否感受到了我的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you feel the love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.47,1:00:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不需瞻前顾后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You needn't look too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.68,1:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚偷偷过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealing through the night's uncertainties.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.65,1:00:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,爱就在眼前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love is where they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.70,1:00:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,若是他今夜坠入爱河{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he falls in love tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.91,1:00:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be assumed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.83,1:00:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他无忧无虑的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His carefree days.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我们将成为历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With us are history.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.96,1:00:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,简单说  我们的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In short, our pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.05,1:00:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,注定不能无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.57,1:01:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方不错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a great place?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.65,1:01:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但是有些事我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't understand something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.37,1:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been alive all this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.08,1:01:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不回到荣耀石呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you come back to Pride Rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.24,1:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想要靠自己  过自己的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I just needed to get out on my own, live my own life.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.17,1:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我这么做了  感觉很棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I did, and it's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.67,1:01:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都需要你回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've really needed you at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.67,1:01:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-没人需要我  -我们需要  你是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one needs me. - Yes, we do. You're the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.59,1:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜  这个我们讨论过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nala, we've been through this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.06,1:01:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是狮子王  刀疤才是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the king. Scar is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.35,1:01:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  他放任土狼们占领了荣耀大地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, he let the hyenas take over the Pride Lands.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.64,1:01:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -一切都毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Everything's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.77,1:01:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,没有水  没有吃的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no food, no water.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.48,1:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  要是你不快点采取措施{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, if you don't do something soon,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.22,1:01:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都会饿死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone will starve.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.27,1:01:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不能回去  -为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't go back. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.61,1:01:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不会了解的  -有什么我不明白的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wouldn't understand. - What wouldn't I understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.94,1:01:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不  不  没关系的  无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. It doesn't matter. Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.61,1:01:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么  -无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Hakuna matata.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.45,1:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我在这里学到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's something I learned out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.06,1:01:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,人生不如意十有八九{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sometimes bad things happen...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.12,1:01:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.28,1:01:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你无能为力  那还何必多虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and there's nothing you can do about it. So why worry?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.62,1:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是你的责任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.94,1:01:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢  你离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what about you? You left.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.25,1:02:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我出来是为了寻求帮助  然后我找到了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I left to find help, and I found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.30,1:02:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗  你是我们唯一的希望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you understand? You're our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.68,1:02:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起  -你到底怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.01,1:02:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我印象中辛巴不是这样的  -你是对的  我不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not the Simba I remember. - You're right. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.64,1:02:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-现在你满意了吗  -不  很失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now are you satisfied? - No. Just disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.31,1:02:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  你说话语气跟我老爸一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're starting to sound like my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.19,1:02:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  起码有个人像他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. At least one of us does.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.36,1:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,听着  你认为你可以突然出现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, you think you can just show up
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.14,1:02:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后指挥我的生活吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell me how to live my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.65,1:02:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你甚至不知道我经历过什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know what I've been through.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.74,1:02:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我  我不就知道了么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would if you'd just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-算了吧  -好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Forget it! - Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.83,1:02:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她错了  我不能回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's wrong. I can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.12,1:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那又能证明什么呢  木已成舟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would it prove, anyway? It won't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.09,1:02:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能改变过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't change the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.09,1:02:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是说会一直在我身边的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you'd always be there for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.72,1:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.64,1:02:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.48,1:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.19,1:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,阿桑特萨那  挤啊挤香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asante sana, squash banana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.28,1:03:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们噜咕  咦咪咪阿帕那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We we nugu, imi mi apana.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,阿桑特萨那  挤啊挤香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asante sana, squash banana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.57,1:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们噜咕  咦咪咪阿帕那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We we nugu, imi mi apana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.37,1:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,阿桑特萨那  挤啊挤香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asante sana, squash banana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.37,1:03:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们噜咕  咦咪咪阿帕那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We we nugu, imi mi apana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,阿桑特萨那  挤啊挤香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asante sana, squash banana.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.37,1:03:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们噜咕  咦咪咪阿帕那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We we nugu, imi mi apana
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.15,1:03:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吧  你能不能歇会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, will you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.90,1:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不能停  一切都会恢复的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't cut it out. It'll grow right back!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.91,1:03:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怪猴子  你能不能别跟着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creepy little monkey. Will you stop following me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.08,1:03:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-你是谁  -问题是  你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - The question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.92,1:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我知道我是谁  现在我不确定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I knew. Now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.21,1:04:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁  过来  是个秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I know who you are. Come here. It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,阿桑特萨那  挤啊挤香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asante sana, squash banana
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.59,1:04:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真是够了  那到底什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough already! What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.10,1:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是你是一只狒狒  而我不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means you are a baboon, and I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.10,1:04:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是老糊涂了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're a little confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.44,1:04:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,错  不是我老糊涂了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong! I'm not the one who's confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.44,1:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-你甚至不知道你是谁  -那你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't even know who you are. - And I suppose you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.94,1:04:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然知道  你是木法沙的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure do. You're Mufasa's boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.45,1:04:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-再见  -等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye. - Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.17,1:04:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你以前认识我爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.34,1:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,纠正一下  现在我也认识他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Correction, I know your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.72,1:04:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我很不想这么说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate to tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.63,1:04:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他很久以前就过世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不  又错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Wrong again!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.47,1:05:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着  我带你去见他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive, and I'll show him to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.31,1:05:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟着老拉飞奇  他认识路  快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You follow old Rafiki. He knows the way. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.24,1:05:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别走那么慢  快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't dawdle. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.49,1:05:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等  等等  -快走  快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, whoa, wait, wait. - Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.66,1:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you slow down?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.01,1:05:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.02,1:05:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我爸爸  那只是我的倒影{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not my father. That's just my reflection.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.76,1:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.55,1:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.60,1:06:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.23,1:06:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他就住在你心里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lives in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.90,1:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.66,1:06:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.21,1:06:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你已经把我忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, you have forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.08,1:06:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我怎么会呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. How could I?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.25,1:06:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经忘了自己是谁  所以你也忘了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have forgotten who you are, and so have forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.09,1:06:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己的内心  辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look inside yourself, Simba.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.76,1:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你比表面的你要强大许多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are more than what you have become.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.60,1:07:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须在生命循环中找到自己的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must take your place in the circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.02,1:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么回去  我已经不再是以前那个我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I go back? I'm not who I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.11,1:07:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,记住你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.03,1:07:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的儿子  也是唯一真正的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my son and the one true king.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.82,1:07:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,记住你是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.54,1:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不  求你了  别离开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please, don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.46,1:07:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.71,1:07:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-爸爸  -记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Father! - Remember!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.37,1:07:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别离开我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.42,1:07:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.93,1:07:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.06,1:07:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是自然气象吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.85,1:07:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-很特殊  你觉得呢  -是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Very peculiar, don't you think? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.10,1:07:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来风向要变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like the winds are changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.69,1:07:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有变化很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.65,1:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但是变化不易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.57,1:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我必须要做什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what I have to do,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.31,1:08:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是回去意味着我必须要面对我的过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but going back means I'll have to face my past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我逃避了这么久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been running from it for so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.41,1:08:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我真  为什么打我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez! What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.08,1:08:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么关系  都过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter. It's in the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.04,1:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  但是还是很痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but it still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.13,1:08:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  过去的伤总是会痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the past can hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.50,1:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但我认为  你可以选择逃避{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the way I see it, you can either run from it
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.17,1:08:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,或者选择从中吸取教训{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or learn from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了吗  那么你接下来要做什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? So what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.10,1:08:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,首先  我要拿走你的棍子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I'm gonna take your stick.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.64,1:08:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不  不  不  别拿我拐杖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no! Not the stick!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.98,1:08:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-你要去哪里  -我要回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey! Where are you going? - I'm going back!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.65,1:08:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,很好  快走  离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good! Go on! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.46,1:08:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,蛆啊  好吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grubs! Grubs!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.17,1:09:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.14,1:09:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事  没事  是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay! Whoa, whoa! It's okay! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不准你再在我睡觉的时候吓唬我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.40,1:09:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,肉食动物真要命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carnivores!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.19,1:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们看见辛巴了吗  -我以为他跟你在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you guys seen Simba? - I thought he was with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.90,1:09:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,开始是  但是我现在找不到他了  他在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was, but now I can't find him. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.03,1:09:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里你找不到他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't find him here!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.74,1:09:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,国王回归了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king has returned.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.16,1:09:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信  他回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe it. He's gone back!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.41,1:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,回去了  你什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone back? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.41,1:09:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's goin' on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.42,1:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-这猴子是谁  -辛巴回去了  他要打败刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's the monkey? - Simba went back to challenge Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁  -刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁有刀疤  -不  他叔叔叫刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's got a scar? - No, it's his uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.92,1:09:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-这猴子是他叔叔吗  -不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The monkey's his uncle? - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.76,1:09:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba's gone back to
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.84,1:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要打败他的叔叔  取而代之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}challenge his uncle to take his place as king.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.99,1:10:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.57,1:10:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-太可怕了  不是吗  -我之前还不愿相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's awful, isn't it? - I didn't want to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.12,1:10:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What made you come back?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.33,1:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我突然明白了一些道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I finally got some sense knocked into me,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.17,1:11:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我头上还有当时留下的包呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've got the bump to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.59,1:11:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有  这是我的王国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, this is my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.34,1:11:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不为之而战  还有谁会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I don't fight for it, who will?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-我会  -这很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will. - It's gonna be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.30,1:11:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,危险  我笑对危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger? I laugh in the face of danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.85,1:11:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这有什么好笑的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see nothing funny about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.69,1:11:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,丁满  彭彭  你们在这里干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Timon! Pumbaa! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.81,1:11:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,愿为你效劳  我的王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At your service, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.02,1:11:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要为了这个破地方跟你叔叔战斗吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna fight your uncle for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.15,1:11:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  丁满  这是我的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Timon. This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.99,1:11:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这里确实需要重新装修一下了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about your fixer-upper!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.20,1:11:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了  辛巴  要是这对你很重要的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Simba, if it's important to you,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会一直陪在你身边的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're with you to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.22,1:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,土狼  我恨土狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyenas. I hate hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.19,1:12:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这可要怎么过去  你有什么计划吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's your plan for getting past those guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.02,1:12:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-活诱饵  -好计划  喂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Live bait. - Good idea. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.19,1:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快点  丁满  你们得分散他们注意力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Timon. You guys have to create a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.24,1:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么做  穿上草裙跳舞吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do, dress in drag and do the hula?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.03,1:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你渴望一块鲜美多汁的肥肉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're hungry for a hunk of fat and juicy meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.74,1:12:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,请吃了我的伙伴彭彭  我做东{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat my buddy Pumbaa here because he is a treat.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.58,1:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快来吃了这美味的猎物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on down and dine on this tasty swine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.62,1:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你们只要排好队等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is get in line.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.75,1:12:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你想吃吗  -想吃  想吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you achin' - Yep, yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.63,1:12:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-来点熏肉  -好的  好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For some bacon? - Yep, yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.59,1:12:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-他是一头肥猪  -是的  是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's a big pig - Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.25,1:12:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你也可以成为一头肥猪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could be a big pig, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.35,1:12:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,娜娜  你去找我妈妈  然后集合雌狮们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nala, you find my mother and rally the lionesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.77,1:12:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我去找刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll look for Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.10,1:12:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沙拉碧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarabi!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.50,1:13:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Scar?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.79,1:13:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的狩猎队在哪里  他们可没好好工作啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is your hunting party? They're not doing their job.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.33,1:13:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,刀疤  没食物了  畜群迁移了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scar, there is no food. The herds have moved on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.46,1:13:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你只是没好好找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're just not looking hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.05,1:13:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,都完了  什么都没有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over. There is nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.13,1:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只有一个选择  必须离开荣耀石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have only one choice. We must leave Pride Rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.14,1:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们哪里都不去  -那你会害死大家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not going anywhere. - You have sentenced us to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.64,1:13:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-那就顺其自然吧  -你不能那么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then so be it. - You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.89,1:13:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是国王  我想怎么做就怎么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the king. I can do whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.27,1:13:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你能做到木法沙国王的一半{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were half the king Mufasa was...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.77,1:13:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做到木法沙国王的十倍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ten times the king Mufasa was!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.36,1:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙  不  木法沙死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa? No, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.08,1:13:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mufasa?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不  是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.88,1:13:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你还活着  怎么可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba! You're alive? How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.97,1:13:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要了  我回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.85,1:14:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.26,1:14:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你还活着  真是个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba! I'm a little surprised to see you alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.02,1:14:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个理由  要不我马上把你咬碎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me one good reason why I shouldn't rip you apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.65,1:14:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你必须理解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, you must understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.69,1:14:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,统治一个王国的压力有多大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pressures of ruling a kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.16,1:14:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要再统治了  退位吧  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are no longer yours. Step down, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.49,1:14:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我会的  当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I would, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.04,1:14:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  还有一个小问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, there is one little problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.37,1:14:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见他们了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see them?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.54,1:14:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他们认为我才是国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think I'm king.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.92,1:14:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不这么想  辛巴才是合法的国王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we don't. Simba's the rightful king.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.76,1:14:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你选择的机会  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The choice is yours, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.05,1:14:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要么退位  要么跟我战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either step down or fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.34,1:14:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要用武力解决吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must this all end in violence?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.26,1:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不想为家庭成员的死负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hate to be responsible for the death of a family member.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-你肯定也这么想吧  辛巴  -没用  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wouldn't you agree, Simba? - That's not gonna work, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.90,1:14:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不吃这一套了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've put it behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.11,1:14:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那你忠实的臣民们呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about your faithful subjects?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.03,1:14:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也不吃这一套吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have they put it behind them?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.07,1:14:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  他在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, what is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.24,1:15:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你还没跟她们说你的小秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you haven't told them your little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.58,1:15:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  现在给你个机会告诉她们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Simba, now's your chance to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.04,1:15:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉她们  是谁应该为木法沙的死负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them who is responsible for Mufasa's death.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.25,1:15:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.80,1:15:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.76,1:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我这不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.64,1:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-是真的  -你们看见了吧  他承认了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's true. - You see? He admits it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.89,1:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-凶手  -不  那是个意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Murderer! - No! It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.98,1:15:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你  木法沙不会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it weren't for you, Mufasa would be alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.33,1:15:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他的死是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your fault he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.78,1:15:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-你否认吗  -不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you deny it? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.44,1:15:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-那么你就有罪  -不  我不是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then you're guilty. - No, I'm not a murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.70,1:15:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  你又有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, you're in trouble again,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.12,1:15:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这次  你爸爸可不会来救你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this time daddy isn't here to save you,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.16,1:15:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,现在所有人都知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now everyone knows why!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.54,1:15:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.21,1:16:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,现在  这情况有点眼熟啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.89,1:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我在哪里见过这样的场面呢  让我想想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have I seen this before? Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.93,1:16:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.14,1:16:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸死之前  就是现在这个局面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just the way your father looked before he died.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.69,1:16:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你一个我的小秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here's my little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.86,1:16:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是我杀了木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed Mufasa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.62,1:16:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不  凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Murderer!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.49,1:16:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-别这样  辛巴  拜托  -告诉他们事实真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, Simba, please. - Tell them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.04,1:16:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真相  真相就在眼前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truth? But truth is in the eye of the behold...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.21,1:16:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.59,1:16:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是我干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.17,1:16:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大点声让他们听到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.14,1:16:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了木法沙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.48,1:17:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  打断一下  借过  好热{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. Pardon me. Comin' through. Hot stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.02,1:17:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-让我出去  让我出去  -让我进去  让我进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me out! Let me out! - Let me in! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.56,1:17:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  不要吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't eat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.31,1:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.98,1:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-这猪是谁  -你在跟我说话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, who's the pig? - Are you talkin' to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.40,1:17:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-他居然叫他猪  -是跟我说话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He called him a pig. - To me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.45,1:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们倒霉了  -是跟我说吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shouldn't have done that. - To me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.36,1:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-这下他们死定了  -应该叫我猪先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now they're in for it. - They call me Mr.Pig!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.33,1:17:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这个  你这个蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that, you stupid...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.08,1:17:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个  还有那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take that and that!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.67,1:18:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑吧  你这个胆小鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run, you yellow-belly!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.78,1:18:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-凶手  -辛巴  辛巴  求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Murderer. - Simba. Simba, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.74,1:18:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  可怜可怜我吧  求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, have mercy. I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.53,1:18:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你不值得我可怜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.70,1:18:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是  辛巴  我是你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Simba, I am family.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.46,1:18:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,土狼才是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the hyenas who are the real enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.42,1:18:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们的错  是他们的主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was their fault. It was their idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.46,1:18:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I believe you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.01,1:18:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我说过得都是假话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you ever told me was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.76,1:18:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.80,1:18:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会杀了自己的亲叔叔吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't kill your own uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.81,1:18:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Scar.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.27,1:18:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.90,1:19:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,辛巴  谢谢你  你真是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simba, thank you. You are truly noble.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.23,1:19:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的  我保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make it up to you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.13,1:19:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我要怎么证明给你看呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how can I prove myself to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.11,1:19:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我  我是说  什么都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me. I mean, anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.20,1:19:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,逃吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.82,1:19:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,逃走吧  刀疤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run away, Scar,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.08,1:19:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别再回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and never return.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.20,1:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.29,1:19:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.50,1:19:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.29,1:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.48,1:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.14,1:20:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友  我刚才听他说我们是敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends? I thought he said we were the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.07,1:20:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我也是这么听到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.07,1:20:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,艾德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ed?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.45,1:20:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不  你听我解释  不  你不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Let me explain. No, you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我不是那个意思  不  不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't mean... No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.90,1:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,时候到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.51,1:22:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.26,1:23:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,找准自己位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Till we find our place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.22,1:23:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命长河中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the path unwinding
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.40,1:23:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,在这生命之环里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the circle....
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.44,1:23:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.74,1:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是生生不息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circle of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.87,1:23:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,《狮子王》
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.88,1:23:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.88,1:23:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
